    "background_story": "Angelique was a renowned fashion designer known for her extravagant and daring designs. However, her confidence in her work often bordered on arrogance. She would frequently boast about her creations, claiming they were the most exquisite and innovative the world had ever seen. Her immodest attitude rubbed many people the wrong way, but Angelique didn't seem to care. She would often interrupt others to talk about her latest designs, barely letting them get a word in edgewise. Despite her off-putting demeanor, Angelique's designs were indeed stunning, and she became a household name in the fashion world. Her immodesty, however, made it difficult for her to form lasting relationships with colleagues and friends, who grew tired of her constant self-aggrandizement.",
